config COMMON_CLK_AX630C
	bool "Axera AX630C (AX620E) clock controllers"
	depends on ARM64 || COMPILE_TEST
	select MFD_SYSCON
	select RESET_CONTROLLER
	help
	  Support for the clock controllers on the Axera AX630C and the rest of
	  the AX620E family. The clock tree is split across nine syscon windows
	  (cpu, common, dispc, flash, mm, periph, vpu and the CPU PLL); one
	  driver serves them all.

	  The same windows hold the SoC's reset lines, in the words next to the
	  clock gates, so the same nodes provide those as well.

	  Say Y if you are building a kernel for an AX620E-family SoC. There is
	  no module option: the controllers must be up before the peripherals
	  that depend on them, which includes storage and serial.
